    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>scale the \"human experience\" thing isn't helping. it feels like a consolation prize for someone who's already been fired from life. when a tool is broken or outdated, you don't try to find the \"humanity\" in it, you just clear it out of the way to make room for something efficient. that's all i am now. just clutter in a system that's moved on.",
